        "Self-study is realistic for IGCSE Mathematics or Biology when past papers are plentiful, and weak wherever feedback is the missing ingredient. Nobody marks an Extended Essay outline or points out that a Chemistry method cannot be repeated. Much of what separates a 5 from a 6 or 7 lies in that feedback, and a short trial lesson is a low-cost way to find out how much of it a student needs.",
        "An online tutor is not better than a good teacher in the room; the advantage is reach. A family searching for IB and IGCSE tutors in Simdega will find the local pool empty, yet a student can still work with someone who has coached this exact course recently, whether that person lives in Pune, Delhi or Bengaluru, and keep the same tutor if school, city or even country changes.",
