        "To use an IB or IGCSE qualification for admission in India, the usual first step is an equivalence certificate from the Association of Indian Universities. NEET-UG and JEE Main set their own subject and eligibility conditions, and CUET-UG access depends on what each university accepts. Those rules change from year to year, so the safe habit is to read the current brochure before choosing subjects in Class 11, not after Class 12.",
